        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "There shall be a Foreman on all jobs on which four or more bricklayers or stone masons are employed, who shall have the sole authority to hire and discharge. The Foreman may work with the tools of the trade, at the contractor's discretion, up to and including jobs on which twelve bricklayers and stone masons (including the Foreman) are employed. The Foreman shall be a non-working Foreman on jobs on which more than twelve bricklayers and stone masons (including the Foreman) are employed.",
            "block_bbox": [
