        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Foreman shall receive not less than two dollars ($2.00) per hour above the journeyman wage stipulated in this Agreement. There may be employed, at the discretion of the Employer, a bricklayer who assumes additional responsibilities, who may be employed as a Sub-Foreman at the minimum rate of fifty cents (50¢) per hour over the stipulated journeymen wage in this Agreement; however the Sub-Foreman shall not have the right or authority to hire or discharge.",
